From 30aaad590dc8416a812afbe35a7d5a30fc01da51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stoatium Build <stoatium@localhost>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 17:09:37 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] feat: debrand and drive branding from environment

AGPL grants no trademark rights, so a redistributable fork must not ship
upstream's marks. Branding now comes from brand.env with neutral defaults:
product name, exec name, app id, author, copyright, appx publisher.

Also:
- drop the hardcoded stoat.chat Squirrel iconUrl in favour of the local asset
- publish only when STOATIUM_PUBLISH_REPO is set, never to upstream's repo
- gate Discord Rich Presence behind a fork-supplied application ID, since
  upstream's would present this build to Discord as "Stoat"
- rename flatpak appstream files to the new app id
